\pard\sa70\par
\pard\sb180\sa100\b\f0\fs23 9:15\u8211?10:00 \u8212? Close with judgment\b0\par
\pard\sa70\par
\pard\sa80\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs21 \u8220?What is complete is the demonstrable governed vertical slice. What remains before enterprise production is durable audit storage, distributed rate limiting, real source authorization, browser E2E tests, formal model evaluation, and environment verification. I would not confuse a strong prototype with a completed production platform.\u8221?\par
